{"id":465,"name":"tangrowth","speciesId":465,"dex":465,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["grass"],"stats":{"hp":100,"attack":100,"defense":125,"special-attack":110,"special-defense":50,"speed":50},"abilities":[{"name":"chlorophyll","hidden":false},{"name":"leaf-guard","hidden":false},{"name":"regenerator","hidden":true}],"height":20,"weight":1286,"baseExp":187,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/465.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/465.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/465.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/465.ogg","genus":"Vine Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon videira","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it."},{"version":"platinum","text":"Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"When it remains still, it appears to be a large shrub. Unsuspecting prey that wander near get ensnared by its vines."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Its vines grow so profusely that, in the warm season, you can’t even see its eyes."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Even if one of its arms is eaten, it’s fine. The Pokémon regenerates quickly and will go right back to normal."},{"version":"sword","text":"Tangrowth has two arms that it can extend as it pleases. Recent research has shown that these arms are, in fact, bundles of vines."},{"version":"shield","text":"Vine growth is accelerated for Tangrowth living in warm climates. If the vines grow long, Tangrowth shortens them by tearing parts of them off."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Draped with long vines, it resembles a shrub in appearance. It swings bundles of vines as though they were arms, wrapping them around prey to ensnare them."}],"flavorPt":"Coberto por longas vinhas, tem a aparência de um arbusto. Ele balança feixes de videiras como se fossem braços, envolvendo-os em volta das presas para capturá-las.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":30,"eggGroups":["plant"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"tangela","speciesId":114,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Sabendo Ancient Power"],"species":"tangrowth","speciesId":465,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":465,"name":"tangrowth","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/465.png"}],"games":[8,9,10,11,14,15,16,17,18,20,23,24],"moves":[{"id":14,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0]]},{"id":15,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0]]},{"id":20,"learn":[[8,"lv",22],[9,"lv",22],[10,"lv",22],[11,"lv",22],[14,"lv",17],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"lv",17],[16,"lv",17],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"lv",17],[18,"lv",17],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"lv",1],[23,"lv",1]]},{"id":21,"learn":[[8,"lv",43],[9,"lv",43],[10,"lv",43],[11,"lv",43],[14,"lv",43],[15,"lv",43],[16,"lv",43],[17,"lv",43],[18,"lv",43],[20,"lv",40],[23,"lv",40]]},{"id":22,"learn":[[8,"lv",19],[9,"lv",19],[10,"lv",19],[11,"lv",19],[14,"lv",7],[15,"lv",7],[16,"lv",7],[17,"lv",7],[18,"lv",7],[20,"lv",16],[23,"lv",16]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0]]},{"id":70,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0]]},{"id":71,"learn":[[8,"lv",8],[9,"lv",8],[10,"lv",8],[11,"lv",8],[14,"lv",10],[15,"lv",10],[16,"lv",10],[17,"lv",10],[18,"lv",10],[20,"lv",1],[23,"lv",1],[24,"lv",1]]},{"id":72,"lea